om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note seed/helix/ollm_factory/om_formalize.om:
note Zero-Leakage English-Only Dual-Pass Formalizer (Pure Seeded OM-2).
note Reads ONLY a prompt file (`note <English>\nfn solve <PARAMS>\n`) — NEVER
note touches expect.txt or tasks.om. Translates general English algorithmic
note specifications across all 5 OM-2 function shapes into formal I/O specs
note for `om_synth.om` and `om_sketch.om`, gated by strict dual-pass agreement
note (Pass 1 semantic evaluator == Pass 2 independent verifier on all test cases;
note fail-closed abstain on any ambiguity or mismatch).
note
note Usage:
note   om_formalize formalize PROMPT_FILE OUT_SPEC
note   om_formalize selfcheck

global fmBuf uchar 16384
global fmOut uchar 16384
global fmPath uchar 4096
global fmNums ulong 16
global fmInA ulong 8
global fmInB ulong 8
global fmInC ulong 8
global fmP1 ulong 8
global fmSt ulong 32

text mForm "formalize"
text mSelf "selfcheck"
text tUsage "usage: om_formalize formalize PROMPT_FILE OUT_SPEC | selfcheck\n"
text tErrIo "om_formalize: I/O error\n"
text tAgree "FORMALIZE_AGREE concept="
text tAbstain "FORMALIZE_ABSTAIN\n"
text tSelfOk "OM_FORMALIZE SELFCHECK PASS agree=6/6 abstain=1/1 zero_expect_access=1\n"
text tSelfFail "OM_FORMALIZE SELFCHECK FAIL step="
text tNl "\n"

text kwEdit "edit"
text kwView "view"
text kwVoid "void"
text kwB " b ulong"
text kwC " c ulong"

